<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <base target="_blank">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aadil Poonawala</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Aadil Poonawala — youngest stakeholder at HOWL. Written for 200+ brands.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Merriweather:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,700;1,300;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Merriweather', Georgia, serif;
            max-width: 640px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.85;
            color: #222;
            background: #fff;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        ::selection {
            background: #90EE90;
        }

        a {
            color: #1a5ea8;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        a:hover {
            background: #90EE90;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #111;
        }

        strong {
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-style: normal;
            margin: 0 0 2rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-style: normal;
            margin: 2.5rem 0 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        }

        p {
            margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
        }

        .volunteer {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 2rem;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }

        .volunteer img {
            height: 48px;
            width: auto;
            display: block;
        }

        .edu-line {
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .edu-batch {
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #888;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 4rem;
            padding-top: 1.5rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: #999;
        }

        img {
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            body { margin: 2rem auto; font-size: 14px; }
            .volunteer { gap: 1rem; }
            .volunteer img { height: 36px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

{{ content | safe }}

<footer class="footer">
    <p>Stand still. The trees ahead and bushes beside you are not lost. Wherever you are is called here, and you must treat it as a powerful stranger.</p>
